SPOILER ALERT!!!!




Something I've never seen mentioned...a different way to get rid of
shopkeepers.  Necessary items:

(just one)..powerful wand (ie wand of cold, fire)

enter the shop, make sure the shop keeper is lined up so that if you exit
the shop, he will be in the line of wand firing.  Exit the shop, and zap
your wand into the shop door.  You will receive the message "The wand
hit's it" or something like that.  Keep zapping until you kill him/her.
This works for me on the latest IBM version of Nethack.


